{"nodes": [{"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_crysldoc", "label": "CrySLDoc", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turns formal CrySL rule specifications \u2014 written for a static analyser \u2014 into browsable HTML documentation for developers, from the same source files, so a machine-checkable spec and human guidance cannot drift apart."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_three_tier_architecture", "label": "Three-Tier Architecture (Java / Python / FreeMarker)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tiers are connected through the filesystem and OS process boundaries rather than in-process calls, so each tier has a single distinct responsibility and the Python LLM work can fail or be switched off without touching the deterministic Java pipeline."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "label": "Tier 1 \u2014 Java Rule Compiler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier2_python_llm_sidecar", "label": "Tier 2 \u2014 Python LLM Sidecar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Java spawns a Python process per enrichment request; content returns over stdout and diagnostics over stderr, kept separate so diagnostics can never leak into published documentation."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier3_freemarker_renderer", "label": "Tier 3 \u2014 FreeMarker Renderer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_composedrule_dto", "label": "ComposedRule DTO", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single central data-transfer object accumulates every generated section so a rule's full documentation travels from Java through the LLM tier to the templates without each stage needing its own carrier type."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_twelve_sentence_generators", "label": "Twelve Sentence-Generator Classes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each class translates exactly one CrySL construct (call order, constraints, predicates, guarantees) into English, so adding a construct means adding a generator rather than editing a monolith."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_cross_rule_dependency_resolution", "label": "Cross-Rule Dependency Resolution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Building a requires/ensures map across all rules derives the dependency tree automatically (Cipher \u2192 SecretKey \u2192 KeyGenerator) instead of requiring it to be hand-maintained per page."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tarjan_scc_collapse", "label": "Tarjan SCC Collapse and Independent Ordering Verification", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strongly-connected components are collapsed via Tarjan's algorithm so the leaf-to-root ordering stays well-defined even when rules reference each other cyclically; a second independent Tarjan pass re-checks the ordering before it is trusted."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rule_serialisation", "label": "Sanitized Fixed-Schema Rule Serialisation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Normalising every rule into a fixed schema with a size cap and path-traversal guard gives the Python side a predictable, bounded input regardless of what the source rule contained."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_dependency_aware_prompting", "label": "Dependency-Aware Prompting", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The secure-example prompt walks the rule's dependency chain and pulls in the constraints and guarantees of the classes it depends on, so the model produces a correct multi-object setup sequence rather than a call in isolation."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rag_grounding", "label": "FAISS RAG Grounding on the CrySL Paper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two distinct grounding mechanisms draw on the same indexed paper: a cached primer that teaches the DSL's semantics once, and per-rule retrieval that pulls passages specific to the class being documented."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_crysl_primer", "label": "Cached CrySL Primer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_shape_crysl_contract", "label": "Priority-Truncated CrySL Contract Shaping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "When the prompt runs long, ORDER and FORBIDDEN are preserved longest while ENSURES/CONSTRAINTS are trimmed first, because call order and forbidden methods are the parts the generated example cannot get wrong."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "label": "Compile-Verify-Repair Loop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic cleanup runs first so no model call is spent on mistakes a rule can fix; compiler diagnostics are then fed back for up to seven rounds, and if all attempts are exhausted a short explanatory comment is published rather than broken code."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_jdk_only_compile_gate", "label": "JDK-Only javac Compile Gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compilation is deliberately run against the JDK alone rather than the project's own dependency tree, so an example that compiles here is guaranteed to compile for a reader who has nothing but a JDK."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_insecure_example_not_gated", "label": "Insecure Example Intentionally Not Compile-Verified", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The insecure example exists to illustrate a flawed usage pattern, not to run, so subjecting it to the compile gate would add cost without adding value."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_placeholder_aware_caching", "label": "Placeholder-Aware Per-Rule Caching", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The cache distinguishes a real answer from a failure placeholder, so a failed generation is retried automatically on the next run while everything that already succeeded is reused for free."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_per_rule_failure_isolation", "label": "Per-Rule Composition Isolation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single malformed .crysl file is skipped with a warning rather than aborting the run, so one bad rule cannot take down the site for the other fifty."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_gpt54mini_runtime_result", "label": "gpt-5.4-mini Gateway Runtime Result", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "4,630 s solo for 51 rules vs 1.28 s with --llm=off; 51/51 secure and 51/51 insecure examples across two runs with zero 429s. The run was repeated because LLM output is non-deterministic and a repeat was the only way to show the perfect compile-gate score was a property of the model rather than a lucky draw."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_explanation_dominated_split", "label": "Explanation-Dominated Phase Split", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "85.9% of wall-clock went to explanations not because explanations were slow but because the code-example phase was unusually cheap \u2014 no rule ever entered a long repair cycle."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_backend_comparison", "label": "Cross-Backend Quality Comparison Table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "gpt-5.4-mini 51/51, gpt-4o-mini 49/51, qwen3-30b 39/51, o4-mini 11/51 on an identical 51-rule set; wall-clock comparisons are indicative only because some runs were measured under concurrency."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_concurrency_slowdown", "label": "~35% Concurrency Slowdown (gpt-5.4-mini)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The concurrent run was 34.8% slower with everything else held constant; the most plausible cause is queueing at the gateway, but with only one pair of runs and time-of-day load variation the figure is reported as an observed difference rather than a measured penalty."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rate_limiter_blindspot", "label": "Client-Side Rate Limiter Blind Spot", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both runs recorded zero wait_for_gateway_slot() pauses because two jobs at ~4.3 requests/minute stay inside the 10 RPM budget \u2014 the limiter only observes our own request rate and cannot see queueing on the gateway side, so zero throttle sleeps is not evidence of an uncontended run."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rule_complexity_not_predictive", "label": "Rule Complexity Does Not Predict Generation Time", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cipher (144 lines, 7 REQUIRES) generated examples in 12.7 s against SecretKey (23 lines, 1 clause) at 12.4 s, and the slow rules are not the same rules between runs \u2014 so cost is a property of the generated code (how many repair rounds it burns) rather than of the specification."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_shared_tempdir_defect", "label": "Shared cognicryptdoc_resources Temp Directory Defect", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The JAR-resource temp directory is a fixed shared path deleted by whichever JVM exits first, so two instances cannot safely run at the same time regardless of --reportPath."}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tse19crysl_paper", "label": "tse19CrySL.pdf \u2014 CrySL Research Paper", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_upb_ai_gateway", "label": "UPB AI-Gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_crysldoc", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_three_tier_architecture", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_three_tier_architecture", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_three_tier_architecture", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier2_python_llm_sidecar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_three_tier_architecture", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier3_freemarker_renderer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_twelve_sentence_generators", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_twelve_sentence_generators", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_composedrule_dto", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_cross_rule_dependency_resolution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_cross_rule_dependency_resolution", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tarjan_scc_collapse", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier2_python_llm_sidecar", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rule_serialisation", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_dependency_aware_prompting", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_cross_rule_dependency_resolution", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rag_grounding", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tse19crysl_paper", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_crysl_primer", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rag_grounding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_shape_crysl_contract", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rag_grounding", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_jdk_only_compile_gate", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_insecure_example_not_gated", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_dependency_aware_prompting", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_gpt54mini_runtime_result", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_upb_ai_gateway", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_gpt54mini_runtime_result", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_explanation_dominated_split", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_gpt54mini_runtime_result", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_backend_comparison", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_concurrency_slowdown", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rate_limiter_blindspot", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_concurrency_slowdown", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_shared_tempdir_defect", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rule_complexity_not_predictive", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_per_rule_failure_isolation", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_placeholder_aware_caching", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier2_python_llm_sidecar", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_backend_comparison", "target": "crysldoc_report_gateway_o4mini_o4mini_runtime_result", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md", "source_location": "\u00a73.4", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "three_tier_generation_pipeline", "label": "Three-Tier Generation Pipeline (rules to rendered site)", "nodes": ["crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier1_java_rule_compiler", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier2_python_llm_sidecar", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_tier3_freemarker_renderer", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_composedrule_dto", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_cross_rule_dependency_resolution"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md"}, {"id": "secure_example_generation_flow", "label": "Secure Example Generation Flow (prompt shaping to compile gate)", "nodes": ["crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rule_serialisation", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_dependency_aware_prompting", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_rag_grounding", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_shape_crysl_contract", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_compile_verify_repair_loop", "crysldoc_report_gateway_gpt54mini_jdk_only_compile_gate", "docs_codebase_analysis_llm_code_writer_secure"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CRYSLDOC_REPORT_GATEWAY_GPT54MINI.md"}]}